@startuml message_passing_adapter_disconnect_flow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

title Disconnect and Cleanup

participant "SCORE message-passing IPC" as Transport
participant "MessagePassingControlServer" as Server
participant "SessionManager" as SessionManager
participant "SessionRegistry" as Registry
participant "Session" as Session
participant "Fixed worker executor" as Executor
participant "DisconnectCleanupCallback" as Cleanup

Transport -> Server: **OnDisconnect(connection)** callback
Server -> SessionManager: OnDisconnect(connection)
SessionManager -> Registry: DetachConnection(connection)
Registry --> SessionManager: Detached session
SessionManager -> Session: Disconnect()
Session -> Session: Stop admission; drain admitted work

note right of Session
	Admitted operations run to completion before disconnect cleanup starts.
end note

... outstanding work drains ...

Executor --> Session: Work drains
Session -> Executor: **TrySubmitCleanup(job)**
Executor -> Session: RunCleanup()
Session -> Cleanup: **cleanup(client_id)**
alt Cleanup succeeds
	Cleanup --> Session: Success
	Session -> Registry: **OnCleanupFinished(success)**
	Registry -> Registry: Release total and UID capacity reservations
else Cleanup fails
	Cleanup --> Session: Failure
	Session -> Registry: **OnCleanupFinished(failure)**
	Registry -> Registry: Quarantine client; retain total and UID reservations
	note right of Registry
		Quarantined reservations reduce the global and per-UID capacity for connections.
	end note
end

@enduml
